The amendment replaced two pilot checks, after the pilot and before the full run, when the pilot revealed the judge fault (Appendix~\ref{app:judge}); sample, prompts, model and decision rules were unchanged. Replies were generated with vLLM. The knowledge score and the paper's known/unknown labels come from the same forced-answer prompt and string grader.

